               END-EXEC.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       COMPUTE-MAKE-0207.
               MOVE SPACES TO WS-KEY-CHAR.
               STRING WS-KEY-CUSTOMER DELIMITED BY SIZE
                         '/'              DELIMITED BY SIZE
                         WS-KEY-POLICY    DELIMITED BY SIZE
                         INTO WS-KEY-CHAR
               END-STRING.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       VALIDATE-MAKE-0208.
               INSPECT WS-KEY-CHAR REPLACING ALL SPACES BY '0'.
               IF WS-STATUS-FAILED
                  PERFORM WRITE-ERROR-MESSAGE
               END-IF.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       DERIVE-ROOF-TYPE-0209.
               INSPECT WS-KEY-CHAR REPLACING ALL SPACES BY '0'.
               IF WS-STATUS-FAILED
                  PERFORM WRITE-ERROR-MESSAGE
               END-IF.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       VALIDATE-EXCESS-0210.
               MOVE SPACES TO WS-KEY-CHAR.
